      "section": "DSH Chinese Minimal Custom Mode",
      "text": "<table align=\"center\">\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BOWLUNA/dsh-custom-mode/main/docs/images/05-assistant-manager.png\" width=\"360\" alt=\"Assistants\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BOWLUNA/dsh-custom-mode/main/docs/images/03-system-prompt.png\" width=\"360\" alt=\"System prompt\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BOWLUNA/dsh-custom-mode/main/docs/images/01-mode-switch.png\" width=\"360\" alt=\"Base mode\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BOWLUNA/dsh-custom-mode/main/docs/images/02-plugin-switches.png\" width=\"360\" alt=\"Plugin switches\"></td>\n</tr>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Install the stable GemChance GitHub release:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://codeload.github.com/GemChance/dsh-chinese-minimal-mode/tar.gz/refs/tags/v2.3.0\n```\n\nRestart the process that serves the profile. The version on the settings page is the one that is running.\n\nDesktop app: install from the in-app Plugins page. The CLI cannot modify `profiles/desktop`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "On Windows, `install.sh` is bash and it needs a `dsh` executable on `PATH`. Otherwise use the `dsh` shipped with DeepSeek Harness, or `node node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh/lib/bin.js`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "1. Open Settings → Custom mode.\n2. Edit the system prompt. Save is directly under the editor.\n3. A new session uses this assistant when `settings.yaml` has no `agent-presets.default` yet. An existing value is left as it is.\n\nOn first install, the plugin creates Custom mode with the Minimal base and initializes `prompt.md` to `你是一个中文助手`. Everything remains editable from Settings, and upgrades do not overwrite existing user data."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "The prompt is `prompt.md`. The next time a model step is assembled, that file is read again. History can load an older draft into the editor; loading does not write. A save computed against an older copy is refused when the file changed underneath. The model can change the same file only through `custom_prompt`, which asks first."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "The page is two branches. This assistant edits the one you have open, and all five base modes can be chosen. New assistant writes only when you click New assistant: Coding, Writing, and Chat stay selectable, and only the official Standard mode is lit. The other four official modes are dim and cannot be chosen there."
